  "body": "Probably `code` (and possibly `kbd`, `samp`, and/or `var` also?) should default to `translate=no`. If some parts of it could be translated, the author can put `translate=yes`, but I suspect in most cases most `code` content shouldn't be auto-translated.\r\n\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/text-level-semantics.html#the-code-element\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#the-translate-attribute",
